2186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186516790 #edb/ref 1071 "The projection of the intersection between the hyperboloid of two sheets $\\frac{5(x-1)^{2}}{4}-\\frac{5(y-2)^{2}}{16}+\\frac{(z-3)^{2}}{4}=-1$ and the plane $z=2$ onto the $xy$-plane is a hyperbola. What are the lengths of the semi-axes of the hyperbola?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186516790 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "30e8d5c3-bff2-59db-90d6-3878e212499e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186516790 #edb/ref 1074 "To find the intersection of the hyperboloid and the plane $z=2$, we substitute $z=2$ into the equation of the hyperboloid:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{5(x-1)^{2}}{4}-\\frac{5(y-2)^{2}}{16}+\\frac{(2-3)^{2}}{4} & =-1 \\\\ \\frac{5(x-1)^{2}}{4}-\\frac{5(y-2)^{2}}{16}+\\frac{1}{4} & =-1 \\\\ \\frac{5(x-1)^{2}}{4}-\\frac{5(y-2)^{2}}{16} & =-1-\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{5(x-1)^{2}}{4}-\\frac{5(y-2)^{2}}{16} & =-\\frac{5}{4} \\\\ -(x-1)^{2}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{4} & =1 \\\\ -\\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{{1}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{{2}^{2}} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of a hyperbola with semi-axes of lengths $1$ and $2.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186516876 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "045330c4-8b5b-55b5-b71b-fe9403aa1a72" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186516876 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186408095 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186516908 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186516954 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186516908 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "5a386b7d-1c57-5048-9724-e307c6b38500" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186516908 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186339004 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186516954 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186516965 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186516954 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "b7b019dc-5193-51bb-bdb4-64a14504da05" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186516954 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186516790 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186516965 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186516876 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186516965 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "c7c29bd2-52a7-58da-bab6-7c5edcb62364" #edb/ref 1759